        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Based on the demands presented in H.1.2 and H.1.3, the security/certificate decisions made in this document are described in detail below. Since some of the demands result in conflictive goals, some of the decisions are a compromise between the demands of the OEMs and the demands of the secondary actors.",
